        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/919ad9/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-22T01:25:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've known a few teachers that did seasonal work during the summer. Things like lifeguaurding, caddying, working at a movie theater or retail. Basically any summer job that a college or high school student would do. You may want to try that. I remember my manager at a pool I lifeguarded at used to say she loved the employees that were teachers working for the summer because they were WAY more mature than the high schoolers. Good luck.</p>",
