        "created_at": "2014-02-22T04:42:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think I'm going to talk with my manager at Donato's and see if they'd be willing to allow me to come back in June, once the teaching year is over.</p><p>Under normal circumstances, I'd be willing to work weekends for them, but I had already planned--and notified them--that I'd need to take off several weekends to demo my own game at various conventions across the Miami Valley. &nbsp;As such, it's not really feasible. &nbsp;I'd be taking off more often than I'd be working. &nbsp;</p><p>I guess we'll see what happens.</p>",
