        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-23T04:27:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Whew!</p><p>So, I talked to my Donato's manager when my shift started today: &nbsp;they're being more than flexible with my messed-up schedule for the coming months. &nbsp;After this coming week, I'll be delivering on weekends only, aside from the weekends that I'm demoing my game at conventions. &nbsp;Come June, I'll be able to take up more hours with Donato's, since I won't be teaching then.</p><p>In the meanwhile, I'll be teaching high school during the week, delivering pizzas on the weekends, and doing Kaplan prep (and freelance writing/editing, and prepping my own company's stuff) in my off-hours. &nbsp;Busy busy busy!</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
